{
  "passageNumber": 30,
  "title": "Where Wind Comes From",
  "units": [
    "第一单元 开始",
    "第二单元 发展",
    "第三单元 结尾"
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "assets/images/00.png",
      "en": "Where Wind Comes From",
      "cn": "第 30 篇",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "en": "When it is windy, we can fly a kite.",
      "cn": "有风的时候，我们可以放风筝。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "en": "But where does the wind come from?",
      "cn": "但是风从哪里来呢？",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "en": "What makes the wind move all the time?",
      "cn": "是什么让风一直移动呢？",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "en": "Scientists explain that it is the sun.",
      "cn": "科学家解释说，是太阳。",
      "unit": 1
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "en": "The sun makes the air move, and makes it blow.",
      "cn": "太阳让空气移动，并让它吹起来。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "en": "When the sun shines on the earth, it makes the earth hot.",
      "cn": "当太阳照在地球上时，它使地球变热。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "en": "Then the earth, like a big oven, makes the air hot.",
      "cn": "然后地球像一个大烤箱一样，把空气变热。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "en": "When the air becomes hotter, it also becomes lighter and rises.",
      "cn": "当空气变得更热时，它也变得更轻并上升。",
      "unit": 2
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "en": "This gives the cool air a chance to come in and take the place of the hot air.",
      "cn": "这给了冷空气进入并取代热空气的机会。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "en": "The hot light air goes up higher and higher until it becomes cool.",
      "cn": "又热又轻的空气越升越高，直到变凉。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "en": "Then it comes down again, and the earth makes it hot again, and it goes upwards again.",
      "cn": "然后它再次下降，地球又把它变热，它又再次向上升。",
      "unit": 3
    },
    {
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "en": "When the air moves, we have wind.",
      "cn": "空气移动时，我们就有了风。",
      "unit": 3
    }
  ],
